f988e17-3c7d-4941-a26b-9dc4c84312fa\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the bartender room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Singing_Lute\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Singing Lute\">Singing Lute</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-119&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-131</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>my heart's an empty vase\n</p><p>looking for roses\n</p><p>looking for posies and pansies\n</p><p>a little colour.\n</p><p><br>\nbrighten up my world, won't you\n</p><p>brighten up my world.\n</p><p>won't you\n</p><p>let your little petals fall in my\n</p><p>clear\n</p><p>glass\n</p><p>heart\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sheet_Music_(The_Singing_Lute)\" title=\"Sheet Music (The Singing Lute)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span